{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And they shall confess.</b> Whichever of them it is, whether man or woman." "<b>In its principal.</b> As it is. Not less than it." "<b>And a fifth of it he adds upon it.</b> Whether he confesses of himself and whether there are witnesses against him, he adds two fifths. And the transmitters of the religion said a fifth of the fifth, and their knowledge is broader than our knowledge."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:22.189135980Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}